### Health check
GET http://localhost:5000/

### Register SuperAdmin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "superadmin",
  "email": "superadmin@mail.com",
  "password": "rahasia123",
  "role": "SuperAdmin"
}

### Register Admin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "email": "admin@mail.com",
  "password": "rahasia123",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Register Customer
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "customer1",
  "email": "customer@mail.com",
  "password": "rahasia123",
  "role": "Customer"
}

### Login (Admin) — simpan token dari response
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@mail.com",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

### Me
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List users (Admin)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List venue types
GET http://localhost:5000/api/venue-types

### Create venue type
POST http://localhost:5000/api/venue-types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Stadion"
}

### List venues
GET http://localhost:5000/api/venues?kota=Jakarta&page=1&limit=10

### Create venue
POST  
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Gelora Bung Karno",
  "alamat": "Jl. Pintu Satu Senayan",
  "kota": "Jakarta",
  "kapasitas": 80000,
  "venue_type_id": 1
}

### List events
GET http://localhost:5000/api/events

### Create event (multipart, tambah banner file manual)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/events
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="nama"

Festival Musik Nusantara
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="tanggal"

2025-10-24
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deskripsi"

Konser akbar
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="venue_id"

1
------WebKitFormBoundary--

### List ticket categories by event
GET http://localhost:5000/api/ticket-categories?event_id=1

### Create ticket category
POST http://localhost:5000/api/ticket-categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "event_id": 1,
  "nama_kategori": "VIP",
  "harga": 500000,
  "kuota_total": 100
}

### List seats by category
GET http://localhost:5000/api/seats?kategori_id=1

### Generate seats
POST http://localhost:5000/api/seats/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kategori_id": 1,
  "jumlah": 50,
  "prefix": "VIP",
  "start_number": 1
}

### Lock seats (Customer token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/seats/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seat_ids": [1, 2, 3],
  "minutes": 15
}

### Unlock seats
POST http://localhost:5000/api/seats/unlock
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "seat_ids": [1, 2, 3]
}
PY